d preflight checks for changes to runtime request identity; recheck current default versions and providers.\n268:- rollout_summaries/2026-11-02T09-07-48-SXcc-hivemind_temperature_removal_and_stopped_run_handoff.md (cwd=/Users/lchingen/hivemind, rollout_path=/Users/lchingen/.codex/sessions/2026/11/02/rollout-2026-11-02T17-07-48-01a19b83-cd09-7d83-842f-760bedb30200.jsonl, updated_at=2026-11-05T21:21:55+00:00, thread_id=01a19b83-cd09-7d83-842f-760bedb30200, focused and full tests passed; no product acceptance claimed)\n272:- temperature, poc-v118, poc-v118-idea, config.load, model.call, request SHA, preflight, scripts/replay.py, scripts/hivemind_api.py, frozen extraction\n410:applies_to: cwd=/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28 and /Users/lchingen/hivemind; reuse_rule=reuse the standards and handoff procedure across Hivemind research work, but do not treat this isolated experiment as a provider ranking or product acceptance.\n416:- rollout_summaries/2026-10-28T14-36-41-8E2o-analyst_standards_handoff_after_step4_audit.md (cwd=/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28, rollout_path=/Users/lchingen/.codex/sessions/2026/10/28/rollout-2026-10-28T22-36-41-01a182f1-1946-7370-ad8c-67ddf79c3a84.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-29T05:29:03+00:00, thread_id=01a182f1-1946-7370-ad8c-67ddf79c3a84, diagnostic only)\n426:- rollout_summaries/2026-10-28T14-36-41-8E2o-analyst_standards_handoff_after_step4_audit.md (cwd=/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28, rollout_path=/Users/lchingen/.codex/sessions/2026/10/28/rollout-2026-10-28T22-36-41-01a182f1-1946-7370-ad8c-67ddf79c3a84.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-29T05:29:03+00:00, thread_id=01a182f1-1946-7370-ad8c-67ddf79c3a84, verified handoff)\n440:- The 90-thesis review asks whether information changes revenue, profitability, cash risk, or competitive position, then separately whether it merits an independent question. Its eight tests are guidance, not rigid all-or-nothing gold. Authoritative sources: `/U